  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EEF 24 25 -Equalities Programming in Kosovo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the project, we are aiming to foster a fairer, more inclusive, better informed, and tolerant democracy. The project will educate and empower a new generation of young activists and equip them with necessary skills to promote human rights, with a particular focus on LGBTQI+ and gender.</narrative>
